  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "Discover a refined coastal lifestyle at 889 Beach Road, Waiake.\r\n\r\nA collection of just six brand-new, standalone freehold residences, thoughtfully designed with a Japanese Wabi-Sabi aesthetic — celebrating natural materials, simplicity, warmth and timeless design.\r\n\r\nJust moments from Waiake Beach and close to Browns Bay and Torbay, these homes offer a beautiful balance of coastal tranquility and modern luxury.\r\n\r\nEach residence features approximately 152–167sqm of floor area and 177–258sqm of land, with four bedrooms, generous living spaces and a single garage. Depending on the residence, layouts offer either 2.5 bathrooms or 2 bathrooms plus 2 toilets.\r\n\r\nHigh-quality finishes have been carefully selected throughout, including bespoke kitchens with Fisher & Paykel appliances, engineered timber flooring, premium wool carpets, fully tiled bathrooms, double glazing and centralised air conditioning.\r\n\r\nThe location is equally appealing, with Waiake Beach, coastal walks and local amenities all close by, together with zoning for Torbay Primary, Northcross Intermediate and Long Bay College.\r\n\r\nSix homes. A rare coastal opportunity. A timeless way of living.\r\n\r\nTitles and CCC are yet to be issued.\r\n\r\nContact us to arrange a private viewing or request the full property information pack.",
